{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":16,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["你們要從西拉穿過曠野，來到少女錫安的山，",{"text":"把羊羔獻給那裡的掌權者。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在亞嫩河渡口，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押人","poem":1},{"noteId":6},{"text":"如同被趕離巢穴的飛鳥。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們對猶大人說：「給我們出個主意，下個決定吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"請讓你們的影子在正午如黑夜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"掩藏逃難的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要出賣逃亡者。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓逃難的摩押人住在你們中間，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"請掩護他們躲避毀滅者。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"欺壓者必逝去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毀滅之事必終止，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"入侵者必從地上消亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，必有一個寶座在愛中堅立，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大衛家的人必坐在上面以信實治國，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"秉公審判，敏行公義。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"我們聽說摩押人驕橫傲慢、狂妄自大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而他們所誇耀的都是虛假的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，他們必為摩押哀哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人人都必哀哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為失去吉珥·哈列設的美味葡萄餅而哀歎、悲傷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"因為希實本的農田荒廢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"西比瑪的葡萄樹枯萎。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各國的君王都來踐踏這些上好的葡萄樹。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它們的枝子曾經伸展到雅謝和曠野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"嫩枝一直蔓延到死海。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我像雅謝人一樣為西比瑪的葡萄樹哀哭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"希實本和以利亞利啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我用眼淚來澆灌你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為再無人為你們的果品和莊稼而歡呼了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"肥美的田園裡聽不到快樂的聲音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"葡萄園裡也無人歌唱，無人歡呼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"榨酒池裡無人榨酒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已經使歡呼聲止息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的內心為摩押，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為吉珥·哈列設哀鳴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像淒涼的琴聲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押人上邱壇祭拜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻累得筋疲力盡；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在廟宇裡禱告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻毫無用處。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["以上是耶和華所說有關摩押的預言。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["現在，耶和華說：「正如一個雇工的工作年限是三年，三年之內，摩押的榮耀必和它的眾民一同消失，殘存的人必寥寥無幾、軟弱無力。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":6,"caller":"+","text":"「摩押人」希伯來文是「摩押的女子」。","reference":{"chapter":16,"verse":2}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/16.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/17.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/15.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}